description = "Laserdisc arcade emulator built on Hypseus Singe (a Daphne fork), 64-bit with audio. Plays daphne.exe data: launch roms/<game>.zip or framefile/<game>.txt. Also plays Singe 1 and Singe 2 games (Singe 2 MP4 video as it is) through the RocketLauncher batch file beside framefile/. Renders with Vulkan or OpenGL, or on the CPU; decodes video with the hardware decoder on Android and Windows, and with FFmpeg on the CPU (CPU Fallback, and Linux). No BIOS needed."
